# Queen's Diamond's {T} adds one mana of the chosen color for each charge counter on it - the two Bot2's Jefferies Tube
# put on it count, whoever put them (CR 122.6, 605.1a) - and that mana may only be spent to cast Bot1's commander
# (CR 106.6, 903.3, 903.3d). The Mountain's {R} pays the whole of a Lightning Bolt, and the Diamond's {R}{R} stays in
# the pool, still restricted; then one of that {R}{R} pays the {R} of Raging Goblin, Bot1's commander, cast from the
# command zone, and the other is left. Mana empties at the end of each step and phase (CR 106.4), so all of this is one
# main phase.

